    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40197" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίμετρ-ον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>something added to</i>
			<i>make good measure excess</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				12.26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				91.11
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ποιεῖν</span>
			make <i>an increase</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				4.13.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.676b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολὺ ποιεῖ τοῦ ψεύδους</span>
